    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizruntimedoc-Replace Ecommerce Cart Merge-v4-spec",
    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Merge API allows retailers to efficiently consolidate shopping cart contents from various sessions or user accounts into a single cart. This operation is crucial for providing a seamless customer experience, particularly when users switch devices or log in after adding items to their cart anonymously. Typical consumers of this API include ecommerce platforms that require functionality to enhance cart management and improve user engagement. By leveraging this endpoint, developers can help users maintain their selected items across different sessions.",
